  m_text: "        Hearts grant energy to your toy. \r\n\r\n        Pencils restore
    your moves. \r\n\r\n        Jellies have no effect when cleared, but they allow
    you to cast a powerful skill.\n\nYou can turn to the second page of the notebook
    on the left to use the toy\u2019s ability"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
